<view class="screen"><challenge-banner order-id="{{orderId}}" bind:leave="leave" /><view class="heading">电子木鱼</view><view class="subtitle">跟着自己的节奏，慢慢静下来。</view><view class="row section"><text>木鱼音效</text><switch color="#b67b4d" checked="{{sound}}" disabled="{{!soundReady || soundSaving}}" bindchange="sound" /></view><view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="error-box" bindtap="refresh">{{hint}}</view><view class="wood-space"><view class="floating {{hit ? 'show' : ''}}">放下执念 +1</view><image class="woodfish {{hit ? 'hit' : ''}}" src="/images/woodfish/woodfish.png" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="tap" /><view class="muted">轻触木鱼</view></view><view class="section count-panel"><view class="muted">今日累计敲击</view><view class="count">{{count}}</view><view class="muted">{{!ready ? '正在同步今日次数…' : pending ? pending + ' 次待同步' : '已同步 · 每一次轻敲都算数'}}</view></view></view>


